[0.003236,"o","No existing configuration found — running first-time setup.\r\nConfiguration Location\r\nConfig file:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-gfi0cov6/config.yaml\r\nSecrets file: /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-gfi0cov6/.env\r\nData folder:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-gfi0cov6\r\nInstall dir:  /home/runner/work/hermes-rust-version/hermes-rust-version/crates/hermes-cli\r\nYou can edit these files directly or use 'hermes config edit'\r\n"]
[0.006278,"o","\r\nTip: jump straight to a section with 'hermes setup model|terminal|gateway|tools|agent', or fill only missing items with --quick.\r\nPress Enter to keep it, or type a new value to change it.\r\n\r\n\r\nMessaging Platforms\r\nToggle with Space, confirm with Enter.\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;10m?\u001b[39m Select platforms to configure:  \r\n\u001b[38;5;14m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14m[ ]\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14m💬 Mattermost  (not configured)\u001b[39m\r\n  [ ] 📡 Signal  (not configured)\r\n  [ ] 💬 Weixin / WeChat  (not configured)\r\n  [ ] 💬 BlueBubbles (iMessage)  (not configured)\r\n  [ ] 🐧 QQ Bot  (not configured)\r\n  [ ] 💎 Yuanbao  (not configured)\r\n\u001b[38;5;14m[\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m↑↓ to move, space to select one, → to all, ← to none, type to filter\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m]\u001b[39m\r\u001b[7A\u001b[33C\u001b[?25h"]
